OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen says being an actor
OL,4,Awill be a disadvantage on Celebrity
OL,5,ATraitors
OL,6,
OL,7,FMichael Sheen has said he thinks being
OL,8,Fan actor will be a disadvantage while
OL,9,Fhe is on Celebrity Traitors.
OL,11,FThe 57-year-old is among the stars who
OL,12,Fwill go head to head in the second
OL,13,Fseries of the BBC reality game
OL,14,Fspin-off.
OL,16,FA total of 21 presenters, comedians,
OL,17,Factors and musicians will try their
OL,18,Fhand at being traitors and faithfuls in
OL,19,Fthe show, which airs on 1 October.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
