OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen says being an actor
OL,4,Awill be a disadvantage on Celebrity
OL,5,ATraitors
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Hollywood actor from Port Talbot
OL,8,Fsaid he wanted to participate because
OL,9,Fhe is a "big fan" of the show and
OL,10,Fwanted to be in the castle after
OL,11,Fpreviously filming in the area.
